        "end": 910,
        "quote": "The current GP and medication review confirm established type 2 diabetes managed by diet and exercise alone, with no glucose-lowering medicine or insulin prescribed, and document that driving-relevant comorbidities have been assessed with no disqualifying effect; the driver mentions that an uncle uses injections, but those medicines belong to the uncle, and a previous referral proposing tablets was never implemented as a current treatment change.",
